ise, and after-sales technical support. This segment serves biologic, generic, and pharmaceutical drug companies. The Contract-Manufactured Products segment is involved in the design, manufacture, and automated assembly of devices used in surgical, diagnostic, ophthalmic, injectable, and other drug delivery systems, as well as consumer products. This segment primarily serves pharmaceutical, diagnostic, and medical device companies. It sells and distributes its products through its sales force and distribution network, contract sales agents, and regional distributors. West Pharmaceutical Services, Inc. was founded in 1923 and is headquartered in Exton, Pennsylvania.","employees":10800,"website":"https://www.westpharma.com","country":"United States","city":"Exton","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Robert W. McMahon C.M.A.","title":"Senior VP & CFO"},{"name":"Ms. Annette F. Favorite","title":"Chief HR Officer & Senior VP"},{"name":"Mr. Shane A. Campbell","title":"SVP & Chief Proprietary Segment Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.6,"tpe":30.73,"ps":4.259,"pfcf":27.92,"peg":1.36,"pb":4.405,"ev_ebitda":17.1,"rev_growth":0.0975,"eps_growth":0.1735,"eps_growth_fwd":0.09425,"eps_growth_next":0.1209,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.01671,"roa":0.02187,"de":44.07,"gross_margin":0.4971,"op_margin":0.03985,"profit_margin":0,"current_ratio":3.18},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":41.33,"sector":18.6,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":52.83,"sector":30.73,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":8.476,"sector":4.259,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":88.06,"sector":27.92,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":3.21,"sector":1.36,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":9.715,"sector":4.405,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":10.28,"sector":44.07,"verdict":"Low debt"},{"k":"rev_growth","label":"Revenue growth","v":0.087,"sector":0.0975,"verdict":"In l